<title>UK: Merrill Lynch adds $30 million to seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch adds $30 million to seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    *$180 MLN     SPREAD     +15 BP    MATURITY    10.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE  L-26.SEP.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.60     FULL FEES   0.25</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.60</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL $150 MLN LAUNCHED 04.SEP.96</p>
<p>	     L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
